REPLACE THIS FILE WITH: theme_tab_background.png
- Role   : Tile used to fill the background of inactive tabs
- Size   : 89 × 41 px  (Chrome tiles this to fill the tab strip)
- Format : PNG-24 with alpha
- Tips   : Keep it subtle — usually a semi-transparent overlay or
           a slight darkening of the frame colour.
           Many themes skip this and rely on colours/tints alone.
